            "id": "20260808A0BYU900",
            "title": "大幅溢价45%！A股存储巨头定增37亿元，多家上市公司认购",
            "image": "https://inews.gtimg.com/om_ls/ONih9Vx5KZbSL3Z4eYPF31aE6JefWJQ0qIoMYM0pEk74kAA_870492/0",
            "link": "https://new.qq.com/rain/a/20260808A0BYU900",
            "author": "名扬四海",
            "pub_date": "2026-08-08 19:12:09",
            "description": "<div class=\"rich_media_content\"><section data-exeditor-arbitrary-box=\"wrap\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(62, 62, 62);font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-align:justify\"><section data-exeditor-arbitrary-box=\"wrap\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(56, 54, 53);letter-spacing:1px;line-height:1.8;padding:0px 10px\"><p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px\"><span style=\"color:rgb(56, 54, 53)\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:1px\">8月7日晚间，国产<span dt-eid=\"\" dt-params=\"\"><span class=\"qnt-link\"><span class=\"qnt-link-text\">存储模组</span></span></span>龙头<span dt-eid=\"\" dt-params=\"\"><span class=\"qnt-link\"><span class=\"qnt-link-text\">江波龙</span></span></span>（301308）披露定增发行报告书，</span></span></span><strong><span style=\"color:rgb(56, 54, 53)\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:1px\">公司完成向特定对象发行股票，实际发行660.71万股，发行价格为560.00元/股，募集资金总额37亿元，扣除发行费用后净额36.68亿元。</span></span></span></strong><span style=\"color:rgb(56, 54, 53)\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:1px\">发行对象最终确定为21家，包括易方达基金、金长江、赵启祥、贺伟等，限售期均为6个月。</span></span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px\"><span style=\"color:rgb(56, 54, 53)\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:1px\"><br/></span></span></span></p></section><section data-exeditor-arbitrary-box=\"wrap\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;line-height:0;margin-bottom:10px;margin-top:10px;text-align:center\"><section data-exeditor-arbitrary-box=\"image-box\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;display:inline-block;height:auto;line-height:0;max-width:100%;vertical-align:middle;width:95%\"><img alt=\"图片\" class=\"qnt-img-img qnr-img-lazy-load-img qnr-img-lazy-load-img-placeholder\" data-src=\"https://inews.gtimg.com/om_bt/ONLL_rkyXK3kwZXxlZmYsuS8V55kaSnsxFkOYXSu2eZA4AA/641\" src=\"https://inews.gtimg.com/om_bt/ONLL_rkyXK3kwZXxlZmYsuS8V55kaSnsxFkOYXSu2eZA4AA/641\" style=\"border-radius:6px;display:inline-block;max-width:100%;width:100%;height:100%\"/></section></section><section data-exeditor-arbitrary-box=\"wrap\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;line-height:0;margin-bottom:10px;margin-top:10px;text-align:center\"><section data-exeditor-arbitrary-box=\"image-box\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;display:inline-block;height:auto;line-height:0;max-width:100%;vertical-align:middle;width:95%\"><img alt=\"图片\" class=\"qnt-img-img qnr-img-lazy-load-img qnr-img-lazy-load-img-placeholder\" data-src=\"https://inews.gtimg.com/om_bt/OvpMGSRg5ACzUay_cNf8RnledSpXBUYbidppcQwD-Nli8AA/641\" src=\"https://inews.gtimg.com/om_bt/OvpMGSRg5ACzUay_cNf8RnledSpXBUYbidppcQwD-Nli8AA/641\" style=\"border-radius:6px;display:inline-block;max-width:100%;width:100%;height:100%\"/></section></section><section data-exeditor-arbitrary-box=\"wrap\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(56, 54, 53);letter-spacing:1px;line-height:1.8;padding:0px 10px\"><p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px\"><span style=\"color:rgb(56, 54, 53)\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:1px\"><br/></span></span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px\"><span style=\"color:rgb(56, 54, 53)\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:1px\">据江波龙招股书，上述发行对象中，王伟民、杨晓斌、黄海华、张旭均为公司发起人股东；彼时，黄海华为公司原监事，张旭为公司原副总经理，杨晓斌时任公司副总经理（已于2024年卸任）。另据公开报道，王伟民曾担任江波龙销售副总、海外销售副总裁等职务。</span></span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px\"><span style=\"color:rgb(56, 54, 53)\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:1px\"><br/></span></span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px\"><span style=\"color:rgb(56, 54, 53)\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:1px\">此外，<span dt-eid=\"\" dt-params=\"\"><span class=\"qnt-link\"><span class=\"qnt-link-text\">星宸科技</span></span></span>（301536）、<span dt-eid=\"\" dt-params=\"\"><span class=\"qnt-link\"><span class=\"qnt-link-text\">阳光电源</span></span></span>（300274）全资子公司阳光电源（三亚）有限公司也现身认购对象名单，二者均获配17.86万股，获配金额为1亿元。</span></span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px\"><span style=\"color:rgb(56, 54, 53)\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:1px\"><br/></span></span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px\"><span style=\"color:rgb(56, 54, 53)\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:1px\">公告显示，江波龙本次定增的<span dt-eid=\"\" dt-params=\"\"><span class=\"qnt-link\"><span class=\"qnt-link-text\">定价基准日</span></span></span>为本次发行A股股票的发行期首日，即2026年6月29日，发行价格不低于定价基准日前20个交易日公司股票交易均价的80%，即不低于452.90元/股。</span></span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px\"><span style=\"color:rgb(56, 54, 53)\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:1px\"><br/></span></span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px\"><span style=\"color:rgb(56, 54, 53)\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:1px\">8月7日收盘，江波龙涨超5%，报386.6元/股，</span></span></span><strong><span style=\"color:rgb(56, 54, 53)\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:1px\">据计算，此次定增价格较收盘价溢价45%。</span></span></span></strong><span style=\"color:rgb(56, 54, 53)\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:1px\">从盘面上看，江波龙股价自去年9月中旬一路上涨，到今年7月初的累计涨幅超过630%，盘中一度逼近750元/股。</span></span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px\"><span style=\"color:rgb(56, 54, 53)\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:1px\"><br/></span></span></span></p></section><section data-exeditor-arbitrary-box=\"wrap\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;line-height:0;margin-bottom:10px;margin-top:10px;text-align:center\"><section data-exeditor-arbitrary-box=\"image-box\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;display:inline-block;height:auto;line-height:0;max-width:100%;vertical-align:middle;width:95%\"><img alt=\"图片\" class=\"qnt-img-img qnr-img-lazy-load-img qnr-img-lazy-load-img-placeholder\" data-src=\"https://inews.gtimg.com/om_bt/OiA_tt52o-BB-l86oNF9DqoXj618ou8CrylJDh6-XwI1wAA/641\" src=\"https://inews.gtimg.com/om_bt/OiA_tt52o-BB-l86oNF9DqoXj618ou8CrylJDh6-XwI1wAA/641\" style=\"border-radius:6px;display:inline-block;max-width:100%;width:100%;height:100%\"/></section></section><section data-exeditor-arbitrary-box=\"wrap\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(10, 10, 11);letter-spacing:1px;line-height:2;padding:0px 12px\"><p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px\"><span style=\"color:rgb(10, 10, 11)\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:1px\"><br/></span></span></span></p><p style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);margin:0px;min-height:1em;padding:0px;text-align:justify\"><span style=\"color:rgb(56, 54, 53)\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:1px\"><br/></span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);margin:0px;min-height:1em;padding:0px;text-align:left;text-indent:0px\"><span style=\"color:rgb(160, 160, 160)\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:1px\">（声明：文章内容仅供参考，不构成投资建议。投资者据此操作，风险自担。） </span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px\"><span style=\"color:rgb(10, 10, 11)\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:1px\"><br/></span></span></span></p></section><section data-exeditor-arbitrary-box=\"wrap\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(160, 160, 160);font-size:14px;letter-spacing:1px;padding:0px 10px\"><p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:rgb(160, 160, 160)\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:1px\">出品丨21财经客户端 21世纪经济报道</span></span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:rgb(160, 160, 160)\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:1px\">编辑丨张嘉钰</span></span></span></p></section></section></div>",
            "source": "qq",
            "kind": 1,
            "language": "zh-CN"
        },
